| **Included protection** | Collision‑Damage Waiver (CDW) with **zero‑deductible**, Theft Protection, Third‑Party Liability, 24 h roadside assistance, free cancellation up to 48 h before pick‑up |
| **Optional extras** | Child‑seat (USD 54 / rental), extra driver (USD 36 / rental), GPS unit (USD 68 / rental) – all can be added at booking |

